{title: Rula Ke Gaya Ishq Tera}
{artist: Stebin Ben}
{key: D#}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#]Kaash tu mere haq [Cm]me hota,        [G#]Banke yakeen shaq [A#]me hota
[D#]Kaash tu mere haq [Cm]me hota,        [G#]Banke yakeen shaq [A#]me hota
Parr [D#]aisa hua nhi,        Tu hai [Cm]meelon durr kahi
Tere [G#]sang pal do pal ko,        [A#]Hasna jo chaaha tooo
Rula ke gaya [D#]ishq tera,        Rula ke gaya [Cm]ishq tera
Ke maane nhi [G#]dil yeh mera,        Kaise [A#]chupp me karau ve
[D#]Yr bichhda [Cm]mila de koyi [D#],        [Cm]Ankhaan raundiyaan zaar [G#]zaar
Hasa de [G#]koyi [A#],        Rula ke gaya [D#]ishq tera
Rula ke gaya [Cm]ishq tera,        Ke maane nhi [G#]dil yeh mera
Kaise [A#]chupp me karau ve,        [D#]Khwaabon se zyaada
[Cm]Aansuon se dosti kar [D#]baithe,        [Cm]Jeene ki khwaaish me
[A#]Lamha-lamha mar [D#]baithe,        D] Khaabon se zyaada
[Cm]Aansuon se dosti kar [D#]baithe,        [Cm]Jeene ki khwaahish me
[A#]Lamhaa lamhaa mar [D#]baithe,        Tu [D#]aise juda hua
Me [Cm]raat tu subha hua,        [G#]Tujh pe me marta rha
Tujhe [G#]yaad me karta raha [D#],        Bhula ke gya [D#]ishq tera
Rula ke gaya [Cm]ishq tera,        Bhula ke gya [D#]ishq tera
Rula ke gaya [Cm]ishq tera,        Kaise [G#]chup main karaaun ve
